// What can be placed, and how a person finds it.
//
// Built from MANIFESTS, which is what makes it testable with no browser and
// what makes it blind to where a component came from: the kit's own components
// and a card somebody pasted in thirty seconds ago arrive here as the same
// shape and rank by the same rules. A palette that could tell them apart would
// be the one place this demo's claim leaked.
import {
  "moonbitlang/core/debug",
  "moonbitlang/core/json",
}
